    "group": "Virulent Vectorium",
    "summary": "[Secure](vsdata:core-rule/secured-objectives) your controlled objectives as your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends if a **DEATH GUARD** unit from your army is in range. Your control then persists until the opponent takes the **objective**. Enemies in range of objectives **[secured](vsdata:core-rule/secured-objectives)** this way count as Afflicted while you still control those objectives.",
